Dreambox is a network drive on dcvmu.com. Files you save here can be opened on another Dreamcast, or downloaded from the website.
Double click !Dreambox to open the drive. Save into the window by dragging a save icon onto it, as with any other directory.
The first time, an error box shows a link code. On dcvmu.com, log in, open your account, choose Archicast and type the code. Then open Dreambox again.
Dreambox needs the network. Files are up to 4MB, and each account has 16MB.
From the command line the drive is Dreambox:$, so *Cat Dreambox:$ works, and so does Dreambox:$.Letter in a save box.
